coverage
# The shard lane's two working directories: .vitest-reports/ is the blob a
# `make fe-unit FE_SHARD=k/N` run writes and `--merge-reports` reads back, and
# it must hold BLOBS AND NOTHING ELSE — the merge parses every file in it. The
# merge's own outputs therefore live one directory over.
.vitest-reports/
.vitest-merge/
# Scratch left behind by a design-review session: a screenshot script or a
# review tool's cache at the package root carries the author's machine paths,
# which never belong in a public tree.
/.*.mjs
/.impeccable/
